WEBVTT

00:00:00.422 --> 00:00:06.481
In this video, you will see what to do when your city entered your home in a contest, and sent you a private link.

00:00:06.481 --> 00:00:11.460
You will link the home to your account, check its details, and add your own photos.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.819
We start from the email.

00:00:13.677 --> 00:00:16.979
Your city sends you an email with a private link for your home.

00:00:16.979 --> 00:00:17.807
Tap the link.

00:00:19.794 --> 00:00:22.601
The link opens a private page for your home.

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:26.426
It says which contest your home is in, and who entered it.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:32.272
If you are not signed in yet, the page asks you to sign in with your email, or with Google.

00:00:32.272 --> 00:00:37.909
We use your email to send you contest updates and results, and the organizer can see it.

00:00:37.909 --> 00:00:40.792
Tap, Yes, this is my home, link it to my account.

00:00:42.771 --> 00:00:44.760
Now the home is on your account.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.489
You can change it until voting ends.

00:00:47.489 --> 00:00:54.590
Change the name, the description, when the lights are on, a tip for visitors, how to see it, parking, and the radio station.

00:00:57.433 --> 00:00:58.798
Tap Save changes.

00:01:00.689 --> 00:01:03.533
Under Photos are the photos your city added.

00:01:03.533 --> 00:01:06.060
You can hide them, but you cannot delete them.

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:08.866
Your own photos, you can delete.

00:01:08.866 --> 00:01:13.217
Tap Add your own photos, and choose pictures from your phone or computer.

00:01:13.217 --> 00:01:15.215
A home can have up to eight photos.

00:01:16.061 --> 00:01:20.274
The home now shows on your profile, under Contests, and under Displays.

00:01:21.128 --> 00:01:23.999
That is how you take over a home your city entered.

00:01:23.999 --> 00:01:26.214
You can change it until voting ends.

00:01:27.565 --> 00:01:29.833
Next up: Edit or withdraw your entry.
